{"4557020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zomdied", "steam_appid": 4557020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4765180, 5032190], "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access now Live!</h1><p>[h3]Playable now:[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Core Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Sandbox Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Co-Op Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ PvP &amp; Multiplayer Races</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ English + Japanese + Portuguese + Spanish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>[h3]COMING BEFORE 1.0[/h3]<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More biomes, items, and zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimizations</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Community &amp; Feedback </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to hear your experiences and how you would like to see the game improve!  Be sure to join our discord to catch up on the latest developments with a daily dev log, report any bugs, make heard what you would like to see added to the game, and find players for multiplayer.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/d158293412cb1cde883d04cb674c667b.poster.avif?t=1787943061\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/d158293412cb1cde883d04cb674c667b.webm?t=1787943061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/d158293412cb1cde883d04cb674c667b.mp4?t=1787943061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The horde is evolving, and the clock is ticking in </strong><strong><i>Zomdied</i></strong><strong>, a procedurally generated survival RPG. Navigate a vast, atmospheric world of shifting biomes and dynamic weather as you manage your vitals against an infection that never sleeps. Experience a unique, escalating challenge through the &quot;Turning&quot; system, where the horde grows stronger and capable, eventually unleashing terrifying turned variants like the cloaked Phantom and the relentless Crazed Glutton. Choose your specializations, master your strategy, and explore a world that changes every time you play. In these dead hours, survival isn't a right, it's a desperate struggle. </strong><strong><i>Try not to zomDIE!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW Story Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/a5be55fd026d1e1deb2e1ede6c602d36.poster.avif?t=1787943061\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/a5be55fd026d1e1deb2e1ede6c602d36.webm?t=1787943061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/a5be55fd026d1e1deb2e1ede6c602d36.mp4?t=1787943061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Great on the Steam Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras/255907d6910c745e736094b1efe1a2c9.avif?t=1787943061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557020/extras_big/255907d6910c745e736094b1efe1a2c9.webp?t=1787943061 width=1560 height=623 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game